{"sections":[{"slug":"超覆盖","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"超覆盖"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">超覆盖</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"超覆盖"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">超覆盖是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中覆盖的推广</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":", $U_\\bullet$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的单纯对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若对所有</span> $n\\geq 0$,\n$$\r\nU_n \\to ({\\operatorname{cosk}_{n-1}U_\\bullet})_n = \\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{sk}_{n-1}\\Delta^n,U_\\bullet)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/有效满射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">有效满射</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余骨架","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余骨架</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">则称之为</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的超覆盖</span> (hypercover). <span lang=\"zh\">进一步</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\operatorname{colim}U_\\bullet =1$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称之为有效超覆盖</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于超覆盖</span> $U_\\bullet$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$U_0 \\to 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">为有效满射</span>,</li>\n<li>$U_1\\to U_0\\times U_0$ <span lang=\"zh\">为有效满射</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">引理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象中的</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">连通对象</span> $U$ (<span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/超完备∞-意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">超完备</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中就是终对象</span> $1$), <span lang=\"zh\">常值单纯对象</span> $U_\\bullet$ <span lang=\"zh\">是超覆盖</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">引理</span></strong>. ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象中的</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/余骨架","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余骨架</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">超覆盖是有效的</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">引理</span></strong>. ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象中的超覆盖的几何实现</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即余极限</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">连通的</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span> $\\mathcal X$, <span lang=\"zh\">如下条件等价</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $X\\in\\mathcal X$, $\\mathcal X_{/X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的超覆盖</span> $U_\\bullet$ <span lang=\"zh\">都是有效超覆盖</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/超完备∞-意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">超完备</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}